    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCC8pSvgQkM",
      "content": "From where we live right now and, and the new house is almost finished. We haven't had a final walkthrough and, and there's still a few little details that need to be completed but I just kinda threw out October 1st is tentative date.",
