      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, okay, yeah and that's no problem at all you know, we're happy to shift dates up or down or any which way. So, no worries if that ends up changing somewhere along the line but perfect! Okay, so yeah, you're moving essentially right next door now to kind of get a gauge on this here especially considering how particular your scenario is.",
