    },
    {
      "content": "I do also see that you had checked that box for requesting help with packing anything we consider packing is anything going into a box. Of course. Again. You know you're headed right next door. So, I did just want to inquire on whether you really were looking to have us you know pack items into boxes carrier those twenty paces over. And then kind of, of you know set those box items down or maybe we wanted to go about that potentially a different way.",
      "name": "Garrison Cobe",
