      "content": "Well, how however I you know, we have actually, we've been living in the same house for 45 years so we've actually never moved. So I don't, is, so I would rather not have to pack everything and then unpack it but I didn't know if there was a way that you know, a moving company like yours would have to just move stuff over without.",
