      "time": "2026-08-26T19:15:58.091293",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Admittedly. There, there really is no easy way to do that. As you could probably imagine you know, something like, you know dishes, things like that. You know what, you know, one could certainly carry the dishes over. But then we would be likely making a whole heck of a lot more trips than if it were in a box. And then we're kinda just to an extent just burning money at that point.",
